            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7905, Fleur-De-Lis Ends Cabinet Pull Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Backplate with Fleur-De-Lis Ends is made for use with cabinet pulls that have a 3 inch center to center. It is available in 5 finishes. A symbol of strength and power, the fleur-de-lis was made famous by the French monarch Louis VII. The Fleur-De-Lis Cabinet Pull Backplate is easy to install and is made out of brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7905 Fleur-De-Lis Cabinet Rose\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
